<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pizzeria Bella - Fresh, Hot & Delicious Pizza</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #c1272d;
            --secondary: #d97706;
            --dark: #1f2937;
            --light: #fefcbf;
            --bg: #fffbf0;
        }
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--light);
        }
        section {
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        #home {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 6rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.5), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513104890138-7c749659a591?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        #home h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--light);
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }
        #home p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #b45309;
        }
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            position: relative;
        }
        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 60px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            margin: 0.5rem auto 0;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .menu-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        .menu-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .menu-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        .menu-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .menu-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }
        .menu-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .menu-name {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--dark);
        }
        .menu-price {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .menu-desc {
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .contact-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 3rem;
        }
        .contact-info h3 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        .contact-info p {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .contact-form {
            background: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .form-group textarea {
            resize: vertical;
            height: 120px;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            #home h1 { font-size: 2.3rem; }
            .nav-links { display: none; } /* Kept simple for raw HTML single file */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home" class="logo">🍕 Pizzeria Bella</a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#menu">Menu</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section id="home">
        <h1>Authentic Italian Wood-Fired Pizza</h1>
        <p>Fresh ingredients, hand-tossed dough, and a passion for tradition baked into every slice.</p>
        <a href="#menu" class="btn">View Our Menu</a>
    </section>

    <section id="menu">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Specialty Menu</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
            
            <div class="menu-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604068549290-dea0e4a305ca?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Classic Margherita Pizza" class="menu-img">
                <div class="menu-info">
                    <div class="menu-header">
                        <span class="menu-name">Classic Margherita</span>
                        <span class="menu-price">$14.99</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="menu-desc">San Marzano tomatoes, fresh mozzarella, fresh basil, and a drizzle of extra virgin olive oil.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1628840042765-356cda07504e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Ultimate Pepperoni Pizza" class="menu-img">
                <div class="menu-info">
                    <div class="menu-header">
                        <span class="menu-name">Ultimate Pepperoni</span>
                        <span class="menu-price">$16.99</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="menu-desc">Loaded with spicy pepperoni, mozzarella cheese, and our signature herb tomato sauce.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Vegetarian Supreme Pizza" class="menu-img">
                <div class="menu-info">
                    <div class="menu-header">
                        <span class="menu-name">Vegetarian Supreme</span>
                        <span class="menu-price">$15.99</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="menu-desc">Bell peppers, red onions, mushrooms, black olives, and sweet sweet corn over mozzarella.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-card">
                <div class="menu-info" style="padding-top: 2rem;">
                    <div class="menu-header">
                        <span class="menu-name">Garlic Knots (6pc)</span>
                        <span class="menu-price">$5.99</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="menu-desc">Freshly baked dough tied up, brushed with rich garlic butter, and sprinkled with parmesan cheese.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-card">
                <div class="menu-info" style="padding-top: 2rem;">
                    <div class="menu-header">
                        <span class="menu-name">Caesar Salad</span>
                        <span class="menu-price">$8.99</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="menu-desc">Crisp romaine lettuce, creamy Caesar dressing, shaved parmesan cheese, and garlic croutons.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-card">
                <div class="menu-info" style="padding-top: 2rem;">
                    <div class="menu-header">
                        <span class="menu-name">Tiramisu</span>
                        <span class="menu-price">$6.50</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="menu-desc">Classic Italian dessert made with coffee-dipped ladyfingers, mascarpone cream, and cocoa powder.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Contact & Location</h2>
        <div class="contact-container">
            <div class="contact-info">
                <h3>Visit Us</h3>
                <p>📍 123 Pizza Lane, Flavor Town, NY 10001</p>
                <p>📞 (555) 123-4567</p>
                <p>✉️ info@pizzeriabella.com</p>
                
                <h3 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Hours of Operation</h3>
                <p>Mon - Thu: 11:00 AM - 10:00 PM</p>
                <p>Fri - Sat: 11:00 AM - 11:00 PM</p>
                <p>Sunday: 12:00 PM - 9:00 PM</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="contact-form">
                <h3>Send a Message</h3>
                <form action="#" method="POST" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Message sent successfully!');">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="name">Name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="email">Email</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="message">Message</label>
                        <textarea id="message" required></textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn" style="width: 100%;">Send Message</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Pizzeria Bella. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
